Package: temp-file-eraser-tool
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Filipe Lopes Pires <filipe.pires@dorier-group.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0
Recommends: python3-nautilus
Homepage: https://github.com/FilipeLopesPires/TempFileEraserTool
Description: Erase regenerable temp, cache and build folders from the file manager
 Right-click a folder and choose "Clean up temp and cache folders". The tool
 searches every subfolder for things your tools can rebuild, such as
 node_modules, Unity's Library, Unreal's Intermediate, __pycache__, bin/obj and
 stray temp files, then lists them with their size for review.
 .
 Uncheck anything you want to keep, choose Move to Trash or Erase permanently,
 and press Erase. System folders, installed application data, symlinks and other
 filesystems are never touched.
